anguage":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"神秘人掳走磨牙，竟是要他去成亲。 为救磨牙，桃夭和柳公子来到天水镇，在镇上闲逛时，桃夭察觉出空气里弥漫的是带雄黄的香料，进入饭馆天仙楼，撞破了天仙楼老板的秘密勾当，老板夫妇受威胁买卖重病之人，却认为这是你情我愿、皆大欢喜之事......","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sEtXCw1nUkP3jmQf2mAQbUtrbtL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sEtXCw1nUkP3jmQf2mAQbUtrbtL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"3164982","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"得知磨牙去向后，桃夭与柳公子装病混入温府，面对满车奄奄一息又心如死灰的病者，桃夭不禁陷入沉思。 桃夭和柳公子混入温府之中，准备伺机将其救出，桃夭识破温夫人身份「媼」，食亡者，能断人死时，得人形者皆为貌美之女，称媼姬。 媼姬宁愿付出生命的代价，也不愿说出磨牙的位置，而另一边，磨牙则遇到了温家小姐山海......","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oEb0y0IN50XA1ohoWYVATEcLklN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oEb0y0IN50XA1ohoWYVATEcLklN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"3164983","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"磨牙与山海进入到幻境之中，面对似曾相识的场景，山海突然唤起昔日恋人的名字若麟。 若麟赠予山海定情信物相约私奔，温夫人究竟对山海说了什么，使其最终放弃了赴约呢？ 山海得知若麟只剩半年寿命后，仍选择继续和他在一起，但是与母亲同为媼姬的山海注定无法与若麟长相厮守......","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":20,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yzgk28s6tIyo8aRNkqmzdzGTzEY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yzgk28s6tIyo8aRNkqmzdzGTzEY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"3212397","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"磨牙说桃夭是个刀子嘴豆腐心的人，表面上谁都不在乎，但其实是个很怕寂寞的人，即便两人日常打闹拌嘴，但磨牙依然坚信桃夭会来救自己。 山海求生的欲望越是低迷，怪物的力量就越强大。 磨牙一次又一次地呼唤山海的名字，试图将其从迷境中唤醒，山海最终无法逃脱被怪物吞噬的命运，得知女儿已死的温夫人因急火攻心而陷入了昏迷，山海的性命是否还有挽回的余地？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":17,"rating":9.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z19o8PVnp6OeFeocEYGyCFKM9Fv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z19o8PVnp6OeFeocEYGyCFKM9Fv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"3229448","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"惊蛰从众人手中救下伤痕累累的媼姬，身为术士的他究竟是善是恶？ 他与媼姬之间又发生了什么事呢？ 不可思议！ 原本应针锋相对的媼姬与术士居然当上了邻居，甚至结为了夫妇？ 惊蛰虽到死都深爱着媼姬，却以人妖殊途的理由劝媼姬离开自己。 这个男人是我的救命恩人，是我此生挚爱的夫君，却也是亲手将我推进地狱的人。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":20,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wRj9PF3f2PzH6YkNHBLdClVjVjH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wRj9PF3f2PzH6YkNHBLdClVjVjH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"3229450","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"媼姬口中绝情的丈夫惊蛰，其实从未离开妻女的身边。 秦管家真身乃照海，面部为一块明镜的妖怪，照海跟随了惊蛰22年，目睹了媼姬与惊蛰之间发生的一切，照海化身秦姓男子，救下遭遇劫匪的媼姬与山海，终于等到了留在她们身边的机会。 照海最终选择用自己一生仅一次的能力，换取山海的重生，时光倒流，重归于初，山海这一次，要做一个幸福的姑娘，管它是妖怪还是人类。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wC8eeQ93Fm8GZtMIunyI3A2ejcY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wC8eeQ93Fm8GZtMIunyI3A2ejcY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/2/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/2"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793377964303,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793377964303,"st